,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","login":"mihe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120298#pullrequestreview-4498823443","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120298","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-15T15:31:57Z"},{"id":4505451185,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDIu6sQ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"382d320008ae96f9177ff24bcb1852cd6a94e4aa","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","login":"mihe","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe"},"body":"I haven't pondered much over alternative solution to this, but I do think this approach is preferrable to #120282 from a performance standpoint.\n\nNote however that unlike #120282, this obviously won't wake all the bodies up when changes are made to the default/global area (which is probably a good thing) meaning sleeping bodies will have stale values until they do wake up again. I doubt it's much of a problem in practice, but worth noting at least.\n\nAnyway, I can confirm that this fixes #120279, and the code looks straight-forward enough to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120298#pullrequestreview-4505451185","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120298","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-16T10:25:40Z"}]